    narr:narration """On 2026-08-21, Quinton Fairweather announced a binding gate: [every Meridian deployment requires a signed release manifest before it ships](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1). The rationale is concrete and retrospective — [two unsigned artifacts reached staging last quarter](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), which he names as the whole reason for the gate. The decision is recorded as a formal [gate item](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) covering [staging and production scope](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4), with [Quinton as owner](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5). All five children are dated the same day and carry a conservation value orientation; none addresses waiver conditions, exception paths, tightening triggers, or reassignment. The frame's questions about what would extend, tighten, waive, or reassign the requirement remain open against this material — the graph holds only the gate's establishment and its proximate cause.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
